<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS -- Issues to watch -- Feb 12.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS -- Issues to watch -- Feb 12.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* Shares of Applied Materials Inc rose more than two points in after-hours trading Tuesday. After the bell, the company released quarterly results that apparently impressed some traders. Applied traded at 47-1/2, up from a close at 45-1/8.</p>
<p>* In overnight trading in London, Intel Corp was up 3/4 at 152-1/2, while International Business Machines Corp rose 1/2 to 145-1/4.  </p>
<p>* Reliance Group Holdings Inc reported fourth quarter earnings per share of $0.30, up from $0.17 a year ago. The First Call estimate was $0.23. The stock closed at 9-3/8.</p>
